        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 2100, 3\" x 3\" Screen Door Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFull Surface Single Acting Spring Hinge for Screen Doors. Door flange is surface applied to door. Jamb flange is surface applied to door jamb.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer 2100 Screen Door Spring Hinge permit doors automatically return to the closed position (Self Closing). \r\nPackaged  with #7 x 3/4\" wood mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Tension Tool is use to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pins hold the Spring in tension after it is set. These adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Bommer 2100 Screen Door Spring Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Weight: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Tension</li>\r\n<li>Button Tips</li>\r\n<li>Door flange surface applied</li>\r\n<li>Jamb flange surface applied</li>\r\n<li>ANSI K84223</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/2100.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 2100 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is discontinued. NONE available.</b>\r\n</p>",
